<title>MALAYSIA: SOCCER-DUNHILL CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-DUNHILL CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the eight-nation Dunhill Cup soccer tournament on Wednesday:</p>
<p> Bosnia    2     Indonesia   0   (halftime 2-0)</p>
<p>Scorers: Sanin Pintul 29, Asim Hrnjic 43  </p>
<p> Zimbabwe    6    Vietnam    0 (halftime 3-0)</p>
<p>Scorers: Gilbert Mushangakhize 5, 8, 55,  Alois Bungira 7,</p>
<p>83, Claudis Zviripaari 70</p>
